  40:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c **** /**
  41:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  * @brief Sum of the squares of the elements of a Q7 vector.
  42:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  * @param[in]       *pSrc points to the input vector
  43:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  * @param[in]       blockSize length of the input vector
  44:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  * @param[out]      *pResult sum of the squares value returned here
  45:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  * @return none.
  46:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  *
  47:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  * @details
  48:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  * <b>Scaling and Overflow Behavior:</b>
  49:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  *
  50:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  * \par
  51:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  * The function is implemented using a 32-bit internal accumulator.
  52:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  * The input is represented in 1.7 format.
  53:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  * Intermediate multiplication yields a 2.14 format, and this
  54:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  * result is added without saturation to an accumulator in 18.14 format.
  55:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  * With 17 guard bits in the accumulator, there is no risk of overflow, and the
  56:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  * full precision of the intermediate multiplication is preserved.
  57:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  * Finally, the return result is in 18.14 format.
  58:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  *
  59:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c ****  */
  60:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/StatisticsFunctions/arm_power_q7.c **** 
